{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the spirit of exploration and nation-building in 1492 Colonization of the New World, a turn-based strategy game set during the Age of Discovery. Tasked with expanding the empire of one of Europe\u2019s great powers, you\u2019ll set sail for the New World, seeking glory, wealth, and a place in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found settlements in the untamed wilderness, manage your growing colonial population, and develop thriving towns across a vast continent. Recruit specialists, cultivate resources, and trade goods both locally and with your homeland to support your growing economy. Interact with indigenous peoples, forming alliances or facing conflict as you expand your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate complex relationships with European rivals, advancing your nation\u2019s culture and technology as you move toward an ultimate goal: declaring independence and leading your colonies to freedom. Do you have the vision, leadership, and strategy to unite your people and withstand the might of the Old World?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based gameplay with deep strategic choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight playable European nations, each with unique strengths</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed economic systems and trade networks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy with native tribes and competing colonial powers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to independence and victory</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich historical atmosphere and emergent scenarios</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course, endure the challenges of the New World, and shape the destiny of a burgeoning nation in 1492 Colonization of the New World!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861100?t=1766229000","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861100/bce838282a7550c07de861c746f8be6c6e4ac3e6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766229000","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861100/cf1140090260a874ce289a7c47375eddf0252b59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766229000","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861100/cf1140090260a874ce289a7c47375eddf0252b59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766229000","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4032340,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover the spirit of exploration and nation-building in 1492 Colonization of the New World, a turn-based strategy game set during the Age of Discovery. Tasked with expanding the empire of one of Europe\u2019s great powers, you\u2019ll set sail for the New World, seeking glory, wealth, and a place in history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found settlements in the untamed wilderness, manage your growing colonial population, and develop thriving towns across a vast continent. Recruit specialists, cultivate resources, and trade goods both locally and with your homeland to support your growing economy. Interact with indigenous peoples, forming alliances or facing conflict as you expand your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate complex relationships with European rivals, advancing your nation\u2019s culture and technology as you move toward an ultimate goal: declaring independence and leading your colonies to freedom. Do you have the vision, leadership, and strategy to unite your people and withstand the might of the Old World?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based gameplay with deep strategic choices</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight playable European nations, each with unique strengths</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed economic systems and trade networks</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diplomacy with native tribes and competing colonial powers</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple paths to independence and victory</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich historical atmosphere and emergent scenarios</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chart your course, endure the challenges of the New World, and shape the destiny of a burgeoning nation in 1492 Colonization of the New World!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Salty Olives"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861100/660b9880c91c14b4abab2691d5b7b9d95bccb1ba/header.jpg?t=1766229000","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.x<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 GHz Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirement